# sha256 of the off-repo inputs of scripts/jarvis_t12.sh.
# Paths are relative to the repository root.  `check`, `calibrate` and `run` refuse on a missing
# file or a mismatch.  The split manifests are the frozen prereg-v1 hashes of the LF blobs
# (`git show HEAD:<path> | sha256sum`): a CRLF checkout (the Windows laptop) hashes differently,
# so the code must reach the VM through git, never as a copied working tree.
